**Step 1.** Create `src/BlueCode.Cli/PlanGate.fs` with three top-level functions and one DU. The module declares `module BlueCode.Cli.PlanGate`.

Required namespace `open` declarations:
- `System` (for Console, IO)
- `System.IO` (for StringWriter)
- `System.Threading` + `System.Threading.Tasks`
- `Spectre.Console` (for Table, AnsiConsole)
- `BlueCode.Core.Domain` (Plan, PlannedStep, Step, ToolName, ToolInput, etc.)
- `BlueCode.Core.Ports` (IToolExecutor)
- `BlueCode.Core.AgentLoop` (runPlanTurn)
