`PlanGate.fs` exists with three public functions (`renderPlan`, `readApprovalKey`, `runPlanGate`) and one DU (`ApprovalAction`). renderPlan produces a Spectre table string with one row per PlannedStep + rationale line. readApprovalKey maps Console.ReadKey to ApprovalAction (a/r/q immediate, e captures comment via ReadLine, junk re-prompts up to 5 times before Quit). runPlanGate orchestrates the loop: runPlanTurn → render → key → dispatch (Accept executes via IToolExecutor with Step records persisted via JsonlSink; Reject/Edit re-call runPlanTurn with [PLAN REJECTED] / [PLAN EDIT NOTE: ...] injection). fsproj registers the file before CliArgs.fs/Program.fs. Cli + Sln builds green; 263/1/0 tests preserved.
